{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             ﻿\n こんにちは 武元唯衣です🕊\n \n \n \n あけましておめでとうございます（＾ν＾）\n ２０２１年、やってやります！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKMW7WHR6K93X9VHCM46KH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKMXA8FGTC2BC4AP0JGGQZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n CDTV ライブ!ライブ!さんの時です🌅\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKMYM15Q3PVRNP008PT65Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKMZTZYAY1NGANMJY2ZAHB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 本当に本当に綺麗で格好良い衣装を作っていただきました。この袖の部分にも靴にも、全てに愛が込もっていて、より力が入りました！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKN0XJXNDRZTSK9ZWN77NY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n いつも沢山優しくして下さる上村さんと小池さん☺︎\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKN1Z6AVQYQN830EJZQXC6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 今年もＪＤ頑張ります！（笑）\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKN3DKDZ1K2T3ECTAF6XSA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 櫻ポーズ🌸\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZKN4PGD52GWSACV83YH2BG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n ピース✌🏻\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 紅白歌合戦でのステージ、個人的に櫻坂46としてのパフォーマンスの中で一番楽しかったです。\n \n 多くの方のお力添えのおかげで、また一つ、素敵な経験をさせていただきました。本当に本当にありがとうございました。\n \n \n \n \n \n またね❕             "}],"source":"archive"}